  "desc": "Green Pin® welded master link to EN 1677-4, grade 8 — the connection between the crane hook and wire-rope or chain sling legs, with a large opening for big lifting points and hooks. Forged in grade 8 alloy steel, quenched and tempered, with a flat part for assembly with an omega link or thimble (from 50 t supplied without flat part). Minimum breaking load 4× WLL (use 5:1 in a wire-rope sling). Painted white, rated −40°C to +200°C. Made to EN 1677-4, ASTM A952/A952M and ASME B30.9. WLL 1.6–125 t for a single leg.",
